# ... but NOT mspec/tags/, which SPEC_STATUS.md points at as the per-file record.
# A global ctags rule (`tags`) matches any directory of that name, so the lists
# the doc promised were never in a clone -- the sweep wrote them, git ignored
# them, and nobody reading the repo could see which spec files DIFF or CRASH.
!mspec/tags/
